  "title": "Easy Cheesy Baked Eggs",
  "description": "In this quick and easy breakfast recipe eggs are cracked on top of a creamy and flavorful sharp Cheddar cheese mixture and baked to delicious perfection",
  "authors": [
    "Heather Rosdail"
  ],
